    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>因为最近中秋节快到了，我想起了两年前的中秋节。这是个很细微很渺小的故事，但对我来说it means a lot。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:00:40</a> 胆囊炎复发</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">00:01:30</a> 应该在疼痛的初始就意识到不对劲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a> 自我厌恶、自我伤害、自我折磨、自我谴责</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">00:03:28</a> 困兽之斗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">00:04:25</a>  本期片尾曲《西湖没有中秋》</span></p>]]></description>
