    <guid isPermaLink="false">6757e440bdb9877a97b99d6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Dec 2024 06:55:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2022-2024的三年间，我看了将近800部影视作品，最后挑出了这55部我在豆瓣全5星评分的我认为的值得一看的作品。算是作为今年下半年一直不上班的还债吧。这份片单，一共分为5个单元，点击时间可以跳转单读收听每个单元。具体文字稿也会发布在我的公众号上（</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SqkUXbYZY1YRDCmuzGGtUA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SqkUXbYZY1YRDCmuzGGtUA"><span>点击这里查看文字版</span></a><span>），感谢你的关注。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> </span><strong><span>第一单元：认识现实世界-15部</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>No.1《思想验证区域》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.2《三个女孩》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.3《中国，革命的世纪》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.4《黄石》系列剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.5《弹子球游戏》第一季</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.6《悲情城市》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.7《成瘾剂量》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.8《疼痛难免》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.9《奈伊》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.10《火神的眼泪》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.11《王冠》系列剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.12《纽约灾星》系列剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.13《大自然的女王》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.14《进击的巨人》系列剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.15《Burning Sun：揭露韩流明星聊天室里的秘密》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> </span><strong><span>第二单元：女人就是主角-21部</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>No.1《龙之家族》系列剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.2《戴洛奇小镇》第一季</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.3《全职》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.4《自闭历程》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.5《今夜一起为爱鼓掌》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.6《女人，四十》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.7《投奔怒海》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.8《诗》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.9《还有明天》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.10《致真理》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.11《天浴》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>No.12《德菲因与卡罗尔：反叛缪斯》</span></li><span>  </span><l